  "body": "### What happened\n\nFailed trying to perform various operations on this face, after merge with PR 239.\n\n<img width=\"2477\" height=\"1169\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b1fdb5ff-4e7f-4af8-b726-b34fa829dc22\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen this file: [cutouts.camproj.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/34534542/cutouts.camproj.zip)\n\nSelect an operation like face, trace, etc. \n\nAttempt to select the appropriate face, edge, etc. to perform the operation. \n\nGenerate the toolpath.\n\nAside: for the selection of the edges of the cutout, it would be helpful to have a box selector to select them as a group rather than have to click them individually.  \n\n### camcraft version and OS\n\n0.13.0 with PR  239 applied.   Fedora 44, Plasma, Nvida\n\n### Screenshots or recording\n\n_No response_",
